    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fight! And Fight Again!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Taking down the corporation is a big task, so if you fail, don\u2019t worry, Wheat Willy has made plenty of spare mechs to reupload your AI to. With each attempt, you\u2019ll pick up new skills and learn new things about the various enemies and gear along the path to victory. Chew your way through hordes of machines as you forge ahead towards the headquarters to finish this once and for all, no matter how much scrap you must make on your way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build Your Bot</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design your perfect killing machine as you pick between randomly dropped weapons, parts and upgrades throughout your run. No two runs are the same with each room dropping a random selection from a huge range of juicy loot for you to choose from to customize your mech along your warpath.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ever Changing Dungeons</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No two runs are the same with randomized rooms each with their own randomly selected objectives, carefully designed to challenge the player in unique and interesting ways. With room objectives, killing everything in sight might not always be needed, but it certainly never hurts!\u00a0</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fight! And Fight Again!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Taking down the corporation is a big task, so if you fail, don\u2019t worry, Wheat Willy has made plenty of spare mechs to reupload your AI to. With each attempt, you\u2019ll pick up new skills and learn new things about the various enemies and gear along the path to victory. Chew your way through hordes of machines as you forge ahead towards the headquarters to finish this once and for all, no matter how much scrap you must make on your way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build Your Bot</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design your perfect killing machine as you pick between randomly dropped weapons, parts and upgrades throughout your run. No two runs are the same with each room dropping a random selection from a huge range of juicy loot for you to choose from to customize your mech along your warpath.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ever Changing Dungeons</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No two runs are the same with randomized rooms each with their own randomly selected objectives, carefully designed to challenge the player in unique and interesting ways. With room objectives, killing everything in sight might not always be needed, but it certainly never hurts!\u00a0</p>",
    "short_description": "A top-down shooter rogue-like that sees its player take control of a mechanized weapons platform designed for one thing and one thing only: \u201cTake down the corporation, by any means necessary. . .\u201d",
